"""Research collection protocols and evidence-to-probability applicability rules.

A schema-valid observation is not a calibration. Only held-out labeled
detector outcomes can yield an empirical Pd/Pfa, and even those estimates
are specific to their test population and configuration.
"""
PROTOCOLS={
"E01":("Microphone characterization","Calibrate each microphone channel before/after tests; record quiet-room and reference tones at several spacings; retain original WAV and calibration certificates.","Frequency response by band, self-noise, gain, reference SPL, interchannel delay, spacing and uncertainty.","Two calibrated microphones, acoustic calibrator, multichannel PCM recorder, ruler/calipers.","Changes no Pd directly; enables later acoustic calibration after linking recordings and detector scores."),
"E02":("Aircraft acoustic characterization","Record independent target-present and target-absent flights/sessions at surveyed distances; keep raw stereo PCM and time-matched ground truth.","RMS dBFS and calibrated SPL (if available), spectra, distance, bearing, flight/session ID, weather and labels.","Microphone array, sound-level meter, GNSS, weather station and recorder.","Feeds acoustic feature extraction and held-out baseline; no automatic transfer to current scenario Pd."),
"E03":("Passive RF background characterization","Collect authorized target-absent spectrum sweeps over multiple sessions; document receiver gain and antenna path loss.","Noise floor, occupied frequencies, bandwidth, interference, instrument settings and timestamps.","Spectrum analyzer or SDR, calibrated receive antenna and frequency reference.","Background data alone cannot estimate target detection; used for future RF null distribution."),
"E04":("Receiver and reference characterization","Bench-test receiver gain/noise, bandwidth, reference availability and synchronization at controlled settings.","Receiver noise, frequency, bandwidth, synchronization error, timing stability and calibration IDs.","SDR, calibrated signal generator, attenuators, spectrum analyzer and time reference.","Characterization inputs only until physical likelihood model and uncertainty are implemented."),
"E05":("Radar background/clutter characterization","Record authorized target-absent clutter and known-target reference measurements across independently labeled sessions.","Clutter-to-noise, receiver frequency, background variability, timestamps and ground-truth labels.","Authorized receive system, surveyed references, clock and environment logger.","Informs future background score distributions; does not directly replace synthetic radar Pd."),
"E06":("Target geometry and motion","Record time-synchronized trajectories with surveyed receiver and illuminator coordinates; verify sensor-relative heading convention.","Range, ground speed, heading, altitude, coordinate reference, timestamp and positioning uncertainty.","GNSS/RTK, aircraft telemetry, synchronized clock and surveyed positions.","Can verify path rate/Doppler geometry; does not establish detection probability."),
"E07":("Environmental characterization","Log weather throughout sensor sessions; align measurements by UTC timestamp and preserve station calibration.","Rain rate, wind, temperature, humidity, pressure and instrument uncertainty.","Weather station, rain gauge, anemometer, thermometer, hygrometer and barometer.","Supports future physical weather calibration; no current automatic Pd adjustment."),
"E08":("Independent multisensor evaluation","Synchronize all sensors and independently labeled target/background sessions; reserve holdout sessions before threshold selection.","Detector score per sensor, availability, target label, session, timestamps, geometry, weather and false alarms.","Synchronized radar/RF/acoustic instruments, GNSS ground truth and common time reference.","Held-out Pd/Pfa can be displayed as an empirical comparison, but not substituted for a different main-page scenario.")
}
EXTRA={
"motion":("Motion Calibration","Measure Doppler and detector scores in independent target/background sessions; document illuminator waveform, geometry and clock uncertainty.","Measured Doppler Hz, detector score, label and session ID.","Passive receiver, frequency reference, independent GNSS/RTK and synchronized recorder.","A held-out comparison may be shown; the synthetic motion-Pd relationship remains uncalibrated."),
"ddl":("DDL Acoustic Intake","Obtain licensed DDL real WAV subset, verify filenames and independent sessions, inspect audio without modifying source files.","PCM WAV, class, distance, bearing, session, sample rate and raw provenance.","Published recordings; optionally calibrated microphone metadata from source.","Filename intake does not establish acoustic Pd; use extracted features in Acoustic Baseline."),
"baseline":("Acoustic Baseline","Extract generic WAV features; train on independent sessions and evaluate held-out target/background recordings.","RMS dBFS, spectral centroid, target label and session ID.","PCM audio recorder, feature extractor, independent ground truth.","Reports empirical held-out acoustic performance for that dataset, not general field performance.")
}
